# Winter Orb also limits its controller’s opponent during that player’s untap step (CR 502.3).
[Bot1 Deck]
Winter Orb
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Forest
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Winter Orb.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T6 Bot2.Untap]
! Bot2.Choose(Island; Forest)
Bot2.Choose(Forest)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = false
